{"id": "EUVD-2026-98941", "enisaUuid": "58397358-c80a-36b5-b7c0-194327087ccc", "description": "MateCloud through 5.0.8 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated user to manage object storage by calling the unprotected /api/v1/admin/storage endpoints in StorageController. Low-privilege or self-registered users can supply arbitrary bucket and objectName values to list objects, obtain pre-signed download URLs for other users' files, delete objects, and upload at chosen keys.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:09", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:59:07", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/matecloud-storage-admin-missing-authz", "https://github.com/mateaix/matecloud/blob/57b1edc0f0b8b964448e2d41ef7ba98751e71d8d/mate-biz/mate-system/src/main/java/vip/mate/system/admin/trigger/controller/StorageController.java#L45-L118", "https://github.com/mateaix/matecloud/blob/57b1edc0f0b8b964448e2d41ef7ba98751e71d8d/mate-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml#L80-L85", "https://github.com/mateaix/matecloud", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/matecloud-through-5.0.8-missing-authorization-via-api-v1-admin-storage-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110108", "GHSA-g49f-wwx4-j76v"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "40d70c8f-0fe0-3862-b152-099a25fcbfcf", "product": {"name": "MateCloud", "vendor": {"name": "mateaix"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22645.0.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "033ad4d7-942a-3983-b8e6-bc549eb87a0c", "vendor": {"name": "mateaix"}}], "isExploited": false}